WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Calculate

2
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:03,170
Can I often come to the new house to play in the future?

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:06,860
This is also your home. Come whenever you want.

4
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:09,990
Sister, did you hear?

5
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:13,180
My brother-in-law said this is my home. I heard it.

6
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:17,220
from now on

7
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:24,100
I'm not alone anymore, Brother Qin

8
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:25,780
I really want to dream today

9
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:30,060
What is your name when you call him Brother Qin?

10
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:34,180
You think about A Tian

11
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:43,360
Will this really be our home from now on?

12
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:46,240
The house will get warmer as you live in it

13
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,120
The yard will be filled with vegetables

14
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:50,150
Shenzi's body will be well taken care of

15
00:00:50,630 --> 00:00:52,110
Xiaoshan can also read and write

16
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,160
Then I will

17
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:57,280
Keep the yard clean

18
00:00:58,160 --> 00:00:59,680
I'm responsible for keeping the days going
